  "title": "VALHI REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER 2025 RESULTS",
  "summary": "Dallas, Texas, March 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Valhi, Inc. (NYSE: VHI) reported a net loss attributable to Valhi stockholders of $53.2 million, or $1.86 per share, in the fourth quarter of 2025 compared to net income of $22.8 million, or $.80 per share, in the fourth quarter of 2024.",
